 SG_ VIN : 7|136@0+ (1,0) [0|0] "" Tester

BO_ 61849 DID_F199_ProgrammingDate: 4 ECU
 SG_ ProgrammingDate : 7|32@0+ (1,0) [0|0] "" Tester


