BO_ 65281 IOID_FF01_FuelPump: 1 ECU
 SG_ ControlValue : 7|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" Tester

BO_ 65282 IOID_FF02_OilPump: 1 ECU
 SG_ ControlValue : 7|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" Tester

